h; Nature\u2019s Bounty; Total; Bristol-Myers Squibb Co.; Ambien; Terminix; Serenity; \"CBS Evening News.\")", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 170, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "64000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761933, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Qa2myeY667", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761920, "segment_id": "FNx0JewN3O", "segment_broadcast_id": "Qa2myeY667", "segment_title": "Colorado / Bryant Rape Trial", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) A civil suit filed by the woman who is accusing Kobe Bryant of rape noted.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64170.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761934, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Qa2myeY667", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761920, "segment_id": "VzlUSSf8LM", "segment_broadcast_id": "Qa2myeY667", "segment_title": "What Does it Mean to You? (Abortion)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) Special Eye on America series focusing on key issues in the presidential election continued.   (Pasadena, California: Sandra Hughes) The positions of President Bush and Senator John Kerry on abortion policy compared. [